brief:
	The Young entrepreneur was not deleted: he comes in the Office girl's place, without a computer, as a special dialogue event now with glitched voice. What happens is open. An idea, not decided: he stands in front of the player, and when they turn to fetch parts he is there too, and when they look right...

== drop-off [effect cambion_glitch]
(neutral) You never came to the after work...
- Uh, you didn't tell me when and where it was.
- What after work?
(problem) I thought I could trust you. Turns out you can't trust anyone. It is so lonely at the top.
- Dude. Are you alright?
	(angry) I've wasted so much time. And thereby also so much money!
- Hey. All is going to be okay.
	(angry) I've wasted so much time. And thereby also so much money!
- Money and fame isn't everything you know.
	(angry) Don't you DARE!
	- Sorry! I was just trying to make you feel better!
		(irritated03) The ONLY thing worth more than money is TIME!
(thinking) Depending on the conversion rate that is. If time is money, what currency are we even talking about? All my calculations. Are they wrong...?
- Dude, you make no sense.
- Can I call someone to come pick you up? You clearly seem out of it.
(irritated03) No one can help me now! I'm doomed! Forever sentenced to a life in poverty! All that time! It never was money! I lost it all!
- Dude, what?
